== stage nu: THEOREM AT -- the occupancy anti-transport ==
   functional: RHS(A) := N - (1/2) sum_z X_z(X_z-1), the exact
   right-hand side of averaged_slope_conversion (nu(A) = E[RHS]).
   exhaustive over all occupancy vectors with N <= 14
   largest concentration ratio N/Y admitting RHS > 0 : 14/5 = 2.8000
   uniform kappa=2  (N=12, Y=6): RHS = 6
   uniform kappa=3  (N=12, Y=4): RHS = 0
   uniform kappa=4  (N=12, Y=3): RHS = -6
   uniform kappa=6  (N=12, Y=2): RHS = -18

   BB's deep-stratum concentration factor is 2^33 (256 shells of
   2^41).  kappa = 2^33 gives RHS = N(3 - 2^33)/2 < 0 for every
   N >= 1: the M-route's occupancy functional is DESTROYED, not
   supplied, by shell concentration.
   E[N(A)] = |A|(1-q^{-t})q^{1-t} depends on A only through |A|;
   C_t(A) >= 0 enters nu with a MINUS sign.  Hence structure can
   only LOWER nu(A) below the |A|-only ceiling.

